    IF NOT (`Art 40 to 49 the provisions apply on the date asked` `the date asked`)
    THEN NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): Art 113's general date has not come
    ELSE IF `the Commission considers the authorisation unjustified`
         THEN JUST TRUE
         ELSE JUST FALSE  -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "Where the Commission considers the authorisation unjustified" (a "where" gate on a duty: reading (b))

