GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE
      `a duly justified request has been made` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the reason is an exceptional reason of public security or the protection of life and health of persons, environmental protection or the protection of key industrial and infrastructural assets` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC `Art 46 party` `Art 46 act`
`Art 46(1) the market surveillance authority's permission to authorise` MEANS
    CONSIDER `Art 46(1) the market surveillance authority may authorise the placing on the market or the putting into service of a specific high-risk AI system within the territory of its Member State` `the date asked` `a duly justified request has been made` `the reason is an exceptional reason of public security or the protection of life and health of persons, environmental protection or the protection of key industrial and infrastructural assets`
    WHEN JUST TRUE THEN PARTY `Art 46 the market surveillance authority` MAY `Art 46(1) authorise the placing on the market or putting into service of the high-risk AI system`
    OTHERWISE FULFILLED  -- nothing is permitted here on these facts

